<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 23/24.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 23/24.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on</p>
<p>Wednesday set the following currency fixings for July 24. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   24.07.97	  23.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.7220	    6.6900</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1939	    2.2152</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.3450	    4.3774</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4646	    3.4347</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5114	    0.5127</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7440	    0.7507</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2742	    0.2768</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9216	    6.9282</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6905	    0.6906</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1641	    1.1539</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
